  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/23/15/k5ms.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"500\"><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Valhelsia Furniture 是我们为 Minecraft 打造的一款家具模组，添加了椅子、凳子、桌子、窗帘等更多物品！除了与 Valhelsia Structures（适用于 1.19.2）完全集成外，此模组还可以单独使用，为您提供大量新的选项来增强您的家园。<br><br><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/22/44/rj7i.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"900\" height=\"375\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblog.valhelsia.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Website-Valhelsia.net-F7F3F5?labelColor=030B14&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"193\" height=\"26\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/rdfQuaM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/396333981601234944?color=F7F3F5&amp;labelColor=030B14&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Discord&amp;label=Discord&amp;logoColor=FBAA3E\" width=\"196\" height=\"26\"></a> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/valhelsia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/Valhelsia?color=F7F3F5&amp;labelColor=030B14&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Twitter&amp;label=Twitter&amp;logoColor=FBAA3E\" width=\"138\" height=\"26\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.reddit.com%252fr%252fValhelsia%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/reddit/subreddit-subscribers/valhelsia?label=Reddit&amp;color=F7F3F5&amp;labelColor=030B14&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Reddit&amp;logoColor=FBAA3E\" width=\"126\" height=\"26\"></a></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>加入我们的 Discord 服务器以获取最新消息、更新日志，并在遇到问题时获得支持。我们还有一个非常活跃的聊天频道和由社区成员提交的图片库。<br><br></strong></span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fValhelsia%253fr%253dcurseforge%2bvalhelsia%2bfurniture%2bmod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/22/34/l9ni.png\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/22/35/cci7.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"200\"></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">以下是使用我们的家具模组可以进行的一些装饰示例。您可以在<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/valhelsia-furniture/screenshots\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#36f;text-decoration:underline\">图片</span></a></span>部分找到所有已有的家具，以及一些关于这些家具特定功能的额外信息。<br><br><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/23/15/n0ch.png\" width=\"1113\" height=\"626\">&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fzupimages.net%252fup%252f23%252f15%252fr3m6.png\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/23/15/r3m6.png\" width=\"1113\" height=\"626\"></a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">除了所有图片外，您还可以在下方找到 Jangro 对模组的 spotlight 视频，这将为您提供更多细节。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/wRXuIBhnBvM?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;<br></span></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/22/35/l9nk.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"200\"></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">随着更新的发布，将添加新的家具，例如东方和提基主题的家具。未来还将提供新的装饰品，如木制梯子、植物、渲染的书籍等...</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/22/21/r6iz.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>查看我们的项目：</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/valhelsia-structures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/22/09/qggx.png\" width=\"386\" height=\"150\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/valhelsia-3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/22/09/vt6c.png\" width=\"386\" height=\"150\"></a></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/valhelsia-5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/22/44/2cpc.png\" width=\"386\" height=\"150\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/valhelsia-enhanced-vanilla\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/22/09/gzpv.png\" width=\"386\" height=\"150\"></a></strong></p>",
